<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JO EPECO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot Jo Epeco</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jo Epeco</para>
  <para style="toc3">Epe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO EPECO</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo waraga man bot jo Epeco, pe pi tyen lok mo ma onongo tye katime i kanica me Epeco, ento ocoyo me nyutu kamaleng yub pa Lubanga ma wok ki bot Yecu Kricito. Yub man tye me kelo gin acweya ducu ma i polo ki ma iwi lobo ite loc pa Yecu Kricito.</para>
  <para style="ip">I dul lok mukwongo me buk man lacoc otito kamaleng ber pa ribe kacel. Dok otito bene kit ma Lubanga yero kwede jone dok timo ki gin kica ikom balgi kun wok ki bot Yecu Kricito. En bene omoko kamaleng cike pa Lubanga me cwalo Cwiny Maleng.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo buk man kun lego lwak pa Lubanga me ribe kacel wek ribe man onen i kwogi me kare ducu, kit macalo dul kom dano tye patpat ento gin ducu ribe kacel, kun dul kom acel acel tiyo tice wek kom ducu obed maber.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mot bot jo pa Lubanga ma gitye i Epeco <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yecu Kricito ki Kanica <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 1:3-3:21">1:3—3:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwo manyen i Kricito <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 4:1-6:20">4:1—6:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Mot ki lega me agiki bot jo Epeco <char style="ior"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-24">6:21-24</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">Tic 18:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lakwena pa Kricito Yecu pi mit pa Lubanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Bot jo pa Lubanga ma gitye i Epeco, ma gin aye jo ma gigene i Kricito Yecu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwot Yecu Kricito omiwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum me cwiny ma kimiyo bot jo ma gitye i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Myero wapwo Lubanga, Won Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, pien i Kricito dong omiyowa kit gum me cwiny ducu matye i polo.<verse eid="EPH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Pimeno en oyerowa wa con i Kricito ma pud peya ocako ocweyo lobo, wek wabed jo maleng inyime labongo bal mo ikomwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Lubanga pi mit ma mere kene onongo dong oyubu wacon ni wan myero wadok lutinone pi tic pa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />En otimo man wek wapak mote me kica me deyo madit ma en omiyo ki wan pi Wode ma en maro. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:14">Kol 1:14</ref> </char></note> Pi remo me to pa Wode ma ocwer pirwa, dong kikokowa woko, kiweko balwa, kit macalo lonyo me kicane dwong kwede, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ma en omiyo botwa madit lawangacel limuk. Pi ryekone ki pi niange ducu, <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />en dong omiyo wangeyo mung me miti mere, kun lubu yub maber ma ceng en oyubu me cobo i Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Yub pa Lubanga ma en bicobo ka karene oromo, en aye me coko jami ducu matye i polo ki iwi lobo, ki ribogi woko kacel ite loc pa Kricito.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Pien jami ducu tiine kun lubu tam pa Lubanga ki mitine. En oyerowa i Kricito pi tame, wek wan wabed jone, kun onongo yam en dong oyubu woko con ni, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />wan Lujudaya ma wan aye jo mukwongo bedo ki gen ikom Kricito, omyero wamii dano gupak deyo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />En bene oyero wun Lurok ma wutye i Kricito, mayam wuwinyo lok ada, ma en aye lok me Kwena Maber me larewu. Wun wuye en, oweko kimiyo ki wun Cwiny Maleng ma con Lubanga ociko pireni, wek obed macalo lanen ma mere madong kiketo ikomwu. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />En aye gin ma kijengo ma nyutu ni wabinongo gin ducu ma Lubanga oyube me miyo botwa ikare ma Lubanga bikoko jone kikome, ma bimiyo dano gipako deyone matek.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega pa Paulo bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Pi lok man, cake ma awinyo pi niyewu ikom Rwotwa Yecu, ki pi mar ma wun wumaro kwede jo pa Lubanga ducu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />omiyo pe akeng pwoyo Lubanga pirwu, kun alwongo nyingwu bene ilegana. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Alego Lubanga pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, Lubanga Won deyo, wek omiwu cwiny me ryeko, dok bene onyutiwu ngec ikome kekene. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Dok bene alego ni en omeny tamwu, wek wuniang ikom gen ma en olwongowu iye, ki ikom mot me lonyo ki deyo madwong ma en miyo bot jone wek obed meggi matwal. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Alego bene wek wuniang ikit ma tekone madwong tutwal ma pe pimeni tye katic kwede i iwa, wan jo ma waye Yecu. Man rom aroma ki tic madit me twer ma en tye kwede, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref> </char></note> ma ceng ocero kwede Kricito ki ikin jo ma oto, ka okete obedo i kabedo me deyo kangete tung acuc i polo.<verse eid="EPH 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />En dong tye malo, loyo kit loc ducu ki twero ki teko ki dito ducu matye i polo, ki nying mo ma oywek i lobo me kare man ki i lobo me kare ma bibinoni bene. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Jab 8:6</ref> </char></note> Lubanga dong oketo jami ducu ite twero pa Kricito wek oloo, dok omiye bot lwak jo ma oye en wek en obed macalo wic, kun loyo jami ducu. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kol 1:18</ref> </char></note> Lwak jo ma guye Yecu gin aye kom Kricito, ma omiyo en opong otum maber woko licwic, kun Kricito bene opong ijami ducu ma ikabedo ducu.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Jo ma oto gudoko jo makwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 2:13">Kol 2:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Ikare ma okato angec onongo wun ducu wubedo jo ma oto pi turu cik ki balwu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ikare ca onongo wulubu yo maracu me lobo man, kun wuwinyo lok pa ngat maloyo twer mogo matye malo i dye yamo, ma en aye cwiny ma kombedi tye katic ki i jo ma dag winyo lok ma Lubanga waco. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Wan ducu yam warom ki jo meno pi lubu miti ma kinywalowa kwedeni, kun wacobo miti me komwa ki gin ma watamo pirwa kenwa; omiyo pi kit mayam watye kwede, kiniga pa Lubanga onongo myero opot ikomwa macalo opoto ikom jo mukeneni ducu. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ento Lubanga lalonyo i kicane, mar ma en omarowa kwede dit tutwal; <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />en ma omiyo kadi bed onongo wadoko jo ma oto pi turu cike, en omiyo wadoko kwo kacel ki Kricito. Lubanga olarowu pi kicane. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Pi ribewa ki Kricito Yecu en ocerowa woko kacel kwede, ka dong oketowa wabedo kacel kwede i polo. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />En otimo man ducu wek enyut ikare ducu ma pud tye anyim lonyone madwong ma pe pime me kica, ma onen ki bere botwa i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Pien pi kicane omiyo en olarowu pi niye. Man pe otime pi tic mo ma wun wutiyo; meno obedo mot pa Lubanga gire. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Pe otime pi ticwu mo, ma omiyo ngat mo owek wake pire. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Wan wabedo ginacweya pa Lubanga; en ocweyowa i Kricito Yecu ni wek wabed jo ma tiyo tic mabeco mayam en oyubu ni omyero watii.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ducu dong guribe gudoko lwak acel i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kong wupo ikit ma wun yam onongo wubedo kwede, wun ma wubedo Lurok ikit me anywali. Lujudaya gilwongowu ni wun jo ma pe kiliro, kun gilwonge ken gi ni gin jo ma gulire, pi liregi ma cing dano otiyo iringo komgi. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Kong wupo bene ni ikare ca onongo wupoke woko kamabor ki Kricito; yam kikoyowu woko ki ikom lwak me Icrael, pe wunywako gicike pa Lubanga ki gin ducu ma en ociko ni ebitimo pi jone. Yam wubedo i lobo man labongo gen mo, Lubangawu bene onongo peke. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ento kombedi i Kricito Yecu wun jo mayam wutye kamabor dong kikelowu cok pi to pa Kricito.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />En kikome okelo kuc ikinwa, omiyo wan kwedwu dong wadoko lwak acel. Pi miyo kome kene en dong okwanyo mone woko ki ikinwa macalo dong omuku cel ca mayam poko kinwa wokoni. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:14">Kol 2:14</ref> </char></note> Pi kelo kuc omiyo en ojwayo Cik pa Moses woko ki gin ma kiciko iye ducu, wek omii wan jo me dul aryoni wadok rok acel manyen ma guribe kacel i en. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1:20</ref> </char></note> Pi tone ikom yatariya odwoko wan rok aryoni ducu bot Lubanga ikom acel, omiyo mone ogik woko. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ica 57:19</ref> </char></note> Yam en Kricito obino otito lok me Kwena Maber me kuc botwu wun jo ma onongo wutye kamabor, ki botwa wan jo ma onongo watye cok. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Pi Kricito wan ducu, wan Lujudaya ki wun Lurok, kiyabo botwa yo i Cwiny Maleng aceli me o bot Lubanga Won.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Kombedi dong wun pe wubedo lurok nyo adonyi; wun kacel ki jo pa Lubanga dong wutye ki paco acel, wun dong wudoko jo me ot pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Wun dong kombedi wudoko ot ma kigero, ma gutine obedo lukwena ki lutit lok pa Lubanga. Yecu Kricito kikome aye obedo got madit me twoke. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Gedo man ocung i Kricito, dok bene tye kadongo me doko ot pa Lubanga maleng i Rwot. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Wun bene kitye kagerowu kacel ikome, wek wubed ot ma Lubanga bedo iye.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Tic ma Paulo otiyo pi Lurok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Piman, alego Lubanga pirwu, an Paulo ma abedo lamabuc pi Kricito pirwu wun Lurok. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />I ada wun dong wutyeko winyo kit ma Lubanga i kicane omiyo ki an tic ma atiyo botwu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Dok bene kit ma onyuta kwede munge, omiyo angeyo, macalo dong atyeko coyo pire malo kany macekceki. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26">Kol 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:27">27</ref> </char></note> Ka wukwano ci wutwero neno maber kit ma aniang kwede i mung ma otiko Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ikare ma okato angec Lubanga yam pe onyutu mung man bot dano adanani, ento kombedi dong onyutu bot lukwenane maleng ki lunebi, pi Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Mung meno tye kit man ni, pi lok me Kwena Maber omiyo Lurok dong gudoko lunywak gum pa Lubanga kacel ki Lujudaya; gudoko dul kom acel kwedgi, gin bene gunongo gin mo ducu kacel kwedgi mayam Lubanga ociko pire i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />An kiketa abedo latic me lok me Kwena Maber pi mot me kica pa Lubanga, ma omiya pi tic me twerone. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Kadi bed ni rwomma onongo tidi tutwal ki ikin jo pa Lubanga ducu, ento en omiya mot man me kica me tito lok me Kwena Maber bot Lurok ikom lonyo madwong pa Kricito ma tere pe tate, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />ki me weko dano onge kit ma en ocobo kwede yub mere me mung ma onen woko kamaleng bot jo ducu. Onongo Lubanga ma ocweyo jami ducuni okano mung man pi kare ducu ma okato angec. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:1b">Kol 1:1b</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:15">2:15</ref> </char></note> Man otime wek kombedi otii ki lwak jo muye Yecu me miyo luloc ki wegi twer ducu matye i polo gunge ryeko pa Lubanga ma kite patpat. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Man olube ki tam pa Lubanga ma onongo yam tye con, ma en ocobo ikom Yecu Kricito Rwotwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Pi Yecu omiyo wan jo ma waye en walimo tekcwiny pi niye, pien en oyabo botwa yo me o inyim Lubanga ki gen. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />En ma omiyo alegowu ni, pe omyero cwinywu odok nyap pi can ma kitye kauna kwede pirwu; pien can man tye me bere botwu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngeyo mar pa Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Lok man aye ma omiyo arumu conga inyim Lubanga Won, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />en aye tye macalo wegi jo me odi ducu ma gitye i polo ki ma gitye i lobo. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Alego ni pi lonyone me deyo omyero omii Cwiny mere opongwu ki teko ki kero madwong i iwu, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />wek Kricito bene obed i iwu pi niyewu. Dok bene alego ni Lubanga omii wucung matek imar macalo yat ma lwite odonyo matut ingom. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Alego bene ni wubed ki teko, ki cwiny me niang, kacel ki jo pa Lubanga ducu, kit ma mar pa Kricito lac kwede, kit mabor kwede, ki kit ma odongo kwede malo, dok kit matut kwede, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />wek wunge mar pa Kricito makato ngec ducu, wek wupong ki gin mo ducu ma opong i Lubanga.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Deyo obed bot Lubanga matwero tiyo tic madwong tutwal makato gin ma watwero lego pire nyo keto i tamwa, pi tekone matye katic ikomwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Pi Kricito Yecu, lwak jo ducu ma oye en omyero gupake nakanaka, ikare pa yalwak ducu. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Wubed kom acel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Pimeno, an ma abedo lamabuc pi Rwot alegowu ni wulub kit kwo ma myero, ma rwate ki lwongo mayam kilwongowu kwede. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:12">Kol 3:12</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:13">13</ref> </char></note> Wuwor jo mukene, wubed mwol, dok wubed jo ma ciro gin ducu ma balo cwiny dano, kun ngat acel acel diyo cwinye ikom lawote ki mar. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Wuket tek me gwoko ribe ma Cwiny Maleng omiyowu wek wubed acel i twec me kuc. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kom tye acel, Cwiny Maleng bene tye acel, kit macalo gen bene tye acel ma Lubanga olwongowu iye. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Rwot tye acel, niye acel, batija acel. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Lubanga bene tye acel ma en aye Won dano ducu. En loyo jo ducu, tiyo i jo ducu, dok bene tye i jo ducu.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ngat acel acel ikinwa olimo mot me kica, ma opore ki mot ma Kricito omiye. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Jab 68:18</ref></char></note> En ma omiyo yam ginacoya owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Ka ceng en oito malo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">ci en otero opii mapol ma en omako ilweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">ci omiyo mot bene bot dano.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Teloke ango ni “En oito malo”? Teloke ni en kong okwongo lor piny. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Ngat ma olor piny en acelu bene aye oito malo kamabor inge polo ducu, wek tye ne onyute i jami ducu. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />En aye omiyo mot bot dano; en omiyo jo mogo me bedo lukwena, jo mukene me bedo lunebi, jo mukene gubed lutit lok me Kwena Maber, jo mukene lukwat ki lupwony. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Ticgi obedo me yubu jo pa Lubanga ki ticgi bene me konyo dano, dok me dongo kom Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />En otimo man wek wan ducu wadok acel iniyewa ki ingeyo Wod pa Lubanga, nio ka wadoko dano mucwiny, ma wategi macalo Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Pimeno pe dok omyero wabedu calo lutino ma giweko yamo me pwony mapatpat wirogi dwokogi tungi ki tungi; ryeko pa dano, ki lok ma kiporo me goba, pe dok bimiyo wacabe acaba. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ma ka meno, omyero walok lok ada ki mar, wek wamede, kun wategi ikit yo ducu nio bot Kricito, ma en aye lawiwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kol 2:19</ref> </char></note> En aye wic, dul kom ducu guribe woko ikome, dok gukube kacel iwang mwot ducu matye iye. Ka dul acel acel tye katiyo tice kakare, miyo kom dongo maber imar.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwo manyen i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />En ma omiyo awaco lok man botwu kun acikowu i Rwot ni, pe omyero pud dok wubed ikit ma Lurok gibedo kwede, itamgi ma konye pekeni. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Tamgi dong onyobe woko, pe dong gitwero niang gin mo, dok bene pe gitwero nywako i kwo ma Lubanga miyo, pi kwiya piny ma obino botgi ki cwinygi ma odingi. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Gin pe dong giparo gin mo, oweko dong gumine ken gi i tim me tarwang, dok bene giwor matek itimo lwak tim carocaro mapol ata labongo lewic. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Ento lok ikom Kricito yam pe kipwonyowu kitmeno! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />I lok ada wun jo ma lubu en, nene wuwinyo lok ikome, dok bene kipwonyowu ki lok ada matye i Yecu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:9">Kol 3:9</ref> </char></note> Kit kwowu macon mayam wubedo kwede ca, kombedi omyero dong wuwek obedi, en kit kwo maca dong obale woko pi miti maracu ma obwolowu. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Wuwek Lubanga dong oroc tam me cwinywu odok manyen, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:10">Kol 3:10</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aca 1:26</ref> </char></note> ka dong wuruk kit pa dano manyen ma kiketo ical pa Lubanga kikome i ada me kit ma atir ki kit maleng.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Jek 8:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Pimeno, wuwek goba obedi; dano acel acel omyero olok lok ada bot dano lawote, pien wan watye macalo dul kom luwotwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Jab 4:4</ref> </char></note> Ka kiniga omakowu, pe wupot i bal; ceng pe omyero opoti ma nongo pud wujul kun wutye ki kiniga i cwinywu, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />dok bene pe wumii kare ki Catan. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Dano mayam bedo kakwalo jami pa jo mukene omyero dong owek kwo obedi; omyero en ocak tiyo tic maber ki cinge, wek onong gin ma omyero opok ki jo ma meggi peke. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Lok mo marac omyero pe okati ki idogwu; wulok lok mabeco keken ma dongo tam pa dano i yo mamite, wek jo ma winyo lokwu gunong kony ki iye. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Pe wumii Cwiny pa Lubanga okum, en Cwiny ma kimiyowu me bedo lanen ma kimwono woko dong ikomwu pi kuru nino ma kibikokowu iye. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Wuwek dong kec cwiny ducu, ki wang ic ki kiniga, daa iwi dano mukene, yet, kacel ki rac cwiny ducu. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:13">Kol 3:13</ref> </char></note> Wubed jo ma lukica ki cwiny maber; dano acel acel omyero otim ber bot lawote. Wutim kica ikinwu kekenwu ki luwotwu ikom balwu, macalo Lubanga otimowu kica ki i Kricito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wulub kit pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Wulub kit pa Lubanga, pien wun lutinone ma en maro. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Nia 29:18</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 40:6">Jab 40:6</ref> </char></note> Wubed kun wulubu yo me mar, macalo Kricito ceng omarowa, ci omine kene pirwa me bedo gitum ma ngwece kur ma gityero bot Lubanga.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Dong pimeno, tim kwele ki tim caro caro ducu, ki woro pe omyero kilwong nyinggi ikinwu pien wun wubedo jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Gin me lewic ki lok mingomingo, nyo kadi lok ki leb malik ma konye peke, omyero bene pe owinye botwu. Ma ka timo jami magi, wumii pwoc bot Lubanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Wuniang maber ni, pe tye ngat mo ki ikin lutim tim abor nyo tim caro, nyo arima ikom jamigi (pien arima romaroma ki woro jami) ma binongo dul mo ma bedo mere iker pa Kricito ki pa Lubanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Pe wuye ngat mo obwolwu ki lok mogo ma tere peke, pien kiniga pa Lubanga bino ikom jo ma pe winyo loke pi kit timginu. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Pimeno, pe wuribe kwedgi. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Yam wubedo i colpiny, ento kombedi dong wudoko dero i Rwot; kitwu omyero dong obed kit pa jo me dero. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Pien nyig ma onyak pi dero nen woko i gin ducu matye maber, dok atir, ki me ada. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Wutem pwonye ikom gin ma yomo cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Pe wuribe ikit tic ducu me piny macol ma pe konyo, ento wunyut kit tic meno woko kamaleng. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Pien bedo me lewic me lok ikom gin ma kitimo i mung. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Gin ducu ma dero omenyo nen woko kamaleng; <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />pien gin manen kamaleng nongo tye i dero. Man aye gin ma omiyo kiwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Coo woko, in ma laninoni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Cer woko ki ikin jo ma oto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">ci Kricito bimenyi.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Wugwoke maber ikit kwo ma wubedo kwede; pe wubed macalo jo ma kwiya piny, ento calo jo maryek. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:5">Kol 4:5</ref> </char></note> Tii ki kare ma itye kwedeni i yo maber, pien nino me kare man opong ki gin marac. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Pimeno, pe wubed ming, ento wutem niang gin ma Rwot mito. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Dok pe omyero wumer ki kongo, pien mero kelo kit me caro. Ma ka mero, wuwek Cwiny Maleng opong cwinywu, <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref>,<ref loc="COL 3:17">17</ref> </char></note> kun wuloko ikinwu kekenwu lok me jabuli, ki wer agoya ki wer akuta me pak maber, kun wuwero ki cwinywu ducu me pako Rwot. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Wupwo Lubanga Won ikare ducu pi jami ducu inying Rwotwa Yecu Kricito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Co ki mon gi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Wumiine kenwu ite loc pa jo mukene, ngat man bot lawote, pi woro Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:18">Kol 3:18</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pet 3:1</ref> </char></note> Wun mon wumiine kenwu ite loc pa cogwu, macalo wumiine kenwu bot Rwot. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Pien laco obedo lawi dakone, macalo Kricito en aye lawi lwak ma oye en, en bene lalargi; gin lwak meno aye kome. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Macalo lwak ma oye Kricito gibedo ite loce, kitmeno mon bene omyero gubed ite loc pa coggi ikit yo ducu. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Kol 3:19</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pet 3:7</ref> </char></note> Wun co bene wumar monwu ikit macalo Kricito omaro kwede lwak ma oye en, ci omiyo kwone pirgi. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />En otimo man me dyero kanica bot Lubanga inge lonye ki pii ki lok, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />wek ekel lwak ma oye en inyime kene macalo nyako ma mwonya tutwal, kun pe tye kamo ma ojunge ki ikome, nyo kadi ki poyo mo bene peke, wek obed leng labongo kamo ma oroce. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Kitmeno, co bene gumar mon gi macalo gimaro komgi ken gi. Ngat ma maro dakone, maro kome kene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Pe tye ngat mo ma dag kome kekene, ento pito ki cam dok gwoko maber macalo Kricito bene tiyo ki lwak jo ma oye en, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />pien wan wa dul kome. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aca 2:24</ref> </char></note> Yam kicoyo ni, “Pi lok man laco biweko wone ki mine, ci biribe woko ki dakone, gin aryonu dong gidoko kom acel.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Man mung madit tutwal. An ki tung bota agonyo tyen loke ni mako kom Kricito ki lwak ma oye en. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Pimeno, laco acel acel ikinwu omyero omar dakone macalo maro kome kene, ki dako bene omyero onen ni eworo cware.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lunyodo ki Lutinogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:20">Kol 3:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Wun lutino, pien wutye i Rwot, wuwiny lunyodowu pien meno obedo gin maber me atima. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Nia 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Nwo 5:16</ref> </char></note> Yam kicoyo ni, “Wor woru ki meni.” Man aye cik mukwongo ma kiciko pien gin maber bia ki iye, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“wek ibed ma nyimi leng dok irii i lobo pi kare malac.” <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:21">Kol 3:21</ref></char></note> Dok wun wego, pe wunget i lutinowu mamiyo kiniga makogi, ento wupitgi gudong maber kun wupwonyogi dok wunyebogi ki kit mabeco ma Rwot pwoyo.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lutic ki luditogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kol 3:22-25</ref> </char>
    </note> Wun lutic, wuwiny luditowu me lobo man ki cwinywu acel, macalo wuwinyo Kricito, kun wulworogi ki myelkom. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ticwu omyero pe obed tic ma yengo wangi keken me yomo cwinygi, ento omyero wutii gin ma Lubanga mito ki cwinywu ducu, macalo wun lutic pa Kricito. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Wutii ticwu ki cwiny maber, macalo wutiyo bot Rwot, ento pe wutii bot dano ni gunen wek gupwowu, <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />kun wungeyo maber ni, kit gin mo keken ma dano mo otiyo maber, Rwot bicule pire marom aroma ki tice ma en otiyo, kadi en latic nyo dano ma lone kene. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:1">Kol 4:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Nwo 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:25">Kol 3:25</ref> </char></note> Dok wun wegi lutic, wutii bene ki luticwu i yo acelu; wuwek burugi obedi, kun wupo ni ladit maloyogi wa ki wun bene tye i polo, en tero jo ducu maromrom.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jami lweny pa Lukricitayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Me agikine, wubed tek i Rwot ki twero me tekone. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Wuruk jami lweny ducu ma Lubanga miyo, wek wucung kun wugenge kekenwu iroro pa Catan. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:3">Gal 4:3</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Kol 2:16</ref> </char></note> Pien wan pe walwenyo ikom dano matye ki kom ki remo, ento walwenyo ki luloc ki wegi twero ma woko, ki ikom luloc ducu maloyo wi lobo ikare man me colpiny, dok ki dul mony mogo maracu me cwiny matye i polo. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Pimeno omyero wuruk jami lweny ducu ma Lubanga miyo, wek okonywu me cungo matek inino marac, ci inge lweny dok pud wubicung ma nongo dong wuyele ikit yo ducu <figure style="fig" alt="So put on God's armor now" file="HK00194B.TIF" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles" ref="6:13">Wuruk jami lweny ducu ma Lubanga miyo</figure> <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Ica 11:5</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Ica 59:17</ref></char></note> Pimeno, omyero wucung ma wutweyo pyerwu woko ki ada, wuruk bene kit ma atir wek obed nyonyo me gengo korwu, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Ica 52:7</ref> </char></note> kun wuyube me tito lok me Kwena Maber me kuc ma bedo macalo war ma wuruku ityenwu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Makato ducu, niye aye omyero obed kwotwu ma bimiyo wutwero neko mac ki ikom atero ma Larac bayo. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Ica 59:17</ref> </char></note> Wumak lare aye obed tok nyonyo me wiwu, ki lok pa Lubanga ma en aye pala lucwan pa Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Wuleg kare ducu kit ma Cwiny telowu kwede ki lega me bako dog. Wubed ma wuyube ilega kare ducu kun wuciro peko, kun wulego pi jo pa Lubanga ducu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Wuleg bene pira wek Lubanga oyab doga, omiya gin ma omyero aloki, wek atuc mung me lok me Kwena Maber ki tekcwiny. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />An lakwenane marom ki ngat mo ni ma cung pi lobone, ento gitweya woko ki nyor. Wuleg wek Lubanga omiya tek wek atit loke ki tekcwiny, kit ma omyero alok kwede.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mot me agiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tukiko, ominwa ma kimaro dok en latic pa Rwot me agena, bititiwu lok ma dok ikoma ki ikom tica. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Tic 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Tem 4:12</ref></char></note> Acwalo en botwu pi lok man kikome, wek en omii wunge kit ma wan watye kwede, dok ocuk cwinywu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char></note><verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Kuc ki mar ki niye ma a ki bot Lubanga Won ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed bot utmegiwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Kica pa Lubanga obed bot jo ducu ma maro Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki mar ma pe to.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>